<title>HONG KONG: Chairman raises SHK Hong Kong stake.</title>
<headline>Chairman raises SHK Hong Kong stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>SHK Hong Kong Industries Ltd told the stock exchange on Wednesday its chairman Tong Fung and Megaland Development Ltd had raised their stake in the company by 37.50 million shares or 2.16 percent of the share capital.</p>
<p>The shares were bought on September 12 at HK$0.49 per shares, the statement said. It gave no further details on the background of Megaland Development.</p>
<p>Shares of SHK Hong Kong rose HK$0.005 to HK$0.495 at midday on volume of 1.02 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
